---
description: Acquire the needed current and comparison Testkit evidence through the installed review hierarchy.
args:
  goal: string
returns: CloseoutInquiry
uses:
  - compareTestkitCloseouts/discoverCloseoutAttempts
  - compareTestkitCloseouts/readAttempt
---
Discover the exact nominated current and prior receipt identities. Read the current candidate with readAttempt. Read the prior attempt when the goal needs its comparison or explanation; otherwise retain null without claiming it was inspected. Independent reviews can run concurrently. The installed session reviewer interprets actual Testkit runner, release and inventory evidence; its callback receipts and resources retain their exact native identities. Return the nominated pair, actual current review and optional actual prior review. Do not replace a failed current test with an earlier success or invent a review when required evidence is unavailable.
